操軍突襲時未能有效迎戰，戰敗被擒，被曹操割去耳鼻手指放歸用以激怒袁紹，被袁紹怒而斬殺。","en":"One of the Eight Colonels of the Western Garden and a veteran of Yuan Shao's army. During the chaos following He Jin's assassination, he went to receive the fleeing young emperor and the Prince of Chenliu. He followed Yuan Shao to Hebei. During the Battle of Guandu, Yuan Shao appointed him commander at Wuchao, but his heavy drinking rendered him unable to mount an effective defense when Cao Cao's forces launched their surprise attack. Defeated and captured, he had his ears, nose, and fingers cut off by Cao Cao, who sent him back to provoke Yuan Shao. Infuriated, Yuan Shao had him beheaded.","jp":"西園八校尉の一人で、袁紹軍の元老。何進が暗殺された後の混乱において、宮中から逃亡した少帝と陳留王を迎え入れた。後に袁紹に従って河北へと赴く。官渡の戦いでは袁紹から烏巣の主将に任じられたが、酒を好む性格が災いして曹操軍の奇襲に有効な応戦ができず、敗れて捕縛された。袁紹を激怒させる目的で曹操に耳や鼻、手指を削がれて送り返され、激怒した袁紹によって斬殺された。","kr":"서원팔교위 중 한 사람이자 원소군의 원로이다. 하진이 암살당한 뒤의 혼란 속에서 궁을 빠져나온 소제와 진류왕을 맞이하러 가기도 했다. 이후 원소를 따라 하북으로 향했다. 관도대전에서 원소에게 오소의 주장으로 임명되었으나, 술을 지나치게 즐긴 탓에 조조군이 기습했을 때 제대로 맞서 싸우지 못하고 패하여 사로잡혔다. 조조가 원소를 격노케 하고자 귀와 코, 손가락을 베어 돌려보냈으나, 결국 격분한 원소에게 참수당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10153","remark":"","surname":"淳于","surnameTc":"淳于","surnameEn":"Chunyu","surnameJp":"淳于","surnameKr":"순우","surnameOther":"","name":"琼","nameTc":"瓊","nameEn":"Qiong","nameJp":"瓊","nameKr":"경","nameOther":"","word":"仲简","wordTc":"仲簡","wordEn":"Zhongjian","wordJp":"仲簡","wordKr":"중간","wordOther":"","icon":"淳于琼","power":"WJ10060","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1009","gender":"0","rule":"72","force":"68","wise":"45","politics":"50","charm":"36","will":"31","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"2","willTalent":"2","weaponMaster":"21/21/21/65/21/7/50/21","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1